{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>港鐵今早8時34分公布，由於何文田站有列車設備故障，觀塘線來往黃埔站及調景嶺站的整體行車時間一度預計需要額外10至15分鐘。至早上8時51分，港鐵指何文田站的故障列車已駛離行車線，觀塘線列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.486374+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T00:46:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:28.070212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:41.385598+00:00","content_hash":"b3f5314423e642ea956e1fc22eb2095ae38f74acffc4c42d22f6a17fe53bb38c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}